\begin_inset Formula $w_i$
\end_inset
, normalized so that 
\begin_inset Formula $\sum_i w_i=1$
\end_inset
,
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
g_{k}(t)\approx 2t\cdot\sum_{i}w_{i}\cdot P_{k}(u_{i})\cdot A(u_{i}\cdot t)\label{eq:gauss}
\end{equation}

\end_inset
which is exact for polynomials of degree 
\begin_inset Formula $2n-1$
\end_inset
; 
\begin_inset Formula $n=1$
\end_inset
, 2, 3 and 4 serve orders 2, 4, 6 and 8 (Table 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
